WEBVTT

video-title-observation
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Dubawa da bincike da ƙarin girma

observation-01
00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:09.700
Duba kewayen idanu, fatar idanu da idanu. Nemi abin da ba daidai ba.

observation-02
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Sai a duba da ƙarin girma. Saita hasken Arclight zuwa mafi ƙarfi.

observation-03
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:24.500
Na'ura kusa da idonka; kusanci idon daman mara lafiya a hankali har gani ya fito.

observation-04
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.500
Ka ce ya kalli dama, sannan hagu.

observation-05
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:46.800
Riƙe fatar idanu a hankali, ya kalli sama da ƙasa. Duba sassan da ka gani a rukuni-rukuni.

structures-01
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Na farko: gashi da gefen fatar ido, sama da ƙasa.

structures-02
00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:02.450
Na biyu: conjunctiva da sclera,

structures-03
00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:07.100
har da aljihun ƙasa.

structures-04
00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:12.900
Na uku: cornea,

structures-05
00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:19.400
da iyakarta da sclera, wato limbus,

structures-06
00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:25.700
da baƙin tsakiyar ido da iris ya kewaye.

conditions-01
00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:34.000
Waɗannan hotunan cututtuka ne daban-daban. Ka ɗauki lokaci ka duba da Arclight.

video-title-chamber-depth
00:01:38.433 --> 00:01:45.800
Zurfin ɗakin gaba na ido

chamber-depth-01
00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:46.850
Ɗakin gaba yana tsakanin cornea da iris.

chamber-depth-02
00:01:46.850 --> 00:01:53.000
Haske daga gefen kunne yana nuna zurfin ɗakin gaba.

chamber-depth-03
00:01:55.500 --> 00:02:00.100
Inuwa a gefen hanci na iya nuna rashin zurfi. Tura shi.

video-title-fluorescein
00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:04.100
Rina cornea da fluorescein

fluorescein-application
00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:09.600
Saka fluorescein da tsiri ko ɗigon Minims.

fluorescein-01
00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:14.000
Duba cornea da haske shuɗi.

fluorescein-02
00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:23.500
Wuraren da saman ya bare ko yake da cuta za su bayyana. Rubuta wurinsu da girmansu.

video-title-lid-eversion
00:02:27.133 --> 00:02:30.367
Juya fatar ido ta sama

lid-eversion-grip
00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:36.700
Riƙe gashin fatar ido ta sama a hankali da babban yatsa da manuniya.

lid-eversion-01
00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:42.200
Da sandar auduga a fatar sama, tallafa ka juya fatar sama.

lid-eversion-02
00:02:42.200 --> 00:02:47.700
Riƙe fatar a juye, ka fara duba cikinta da ido kawai.

lid-eversion-03
00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:51.400
Kusanto da Arclight don gani da girma.
